"Images you copy hang on the line too" = "复制的图片也会挂到晾衣绳上";
"Images you copy, like a screenshot taken with Control held or Copy Image in a browser, will hang on the line as well. Tendedero only keeps images, never text, and skips anything a password manager marks as private. You can change this from the menu bar." = "复制的图片也会挂到晾衣绳上，例如按住 Control 截图或浏览器里的“复制图片”。Tendedero 只保留图片，不保留文字，并跳过密码管理器标为私密的内容。你可以从菜单栏更改此设置。";
"New screenshots will be saved here while Handle screenshots is on. Existing files stay where they are." = "开启接管截图后，新截图将保存到这里。已有文件不会迁移或导入。";
"New screenshots will be saved in the chosen folder and hang instantly, without the floating thumbnail. The cross moves files in Tendedero’s own folder to the Trash; in other folders, it only takes them down. You can turn this off from the menu bar, and your previous settings come back when Tendedero quits." = "新截图将保存到所选目录并立即挂上晾衣绳，不显示浮动缩略图。点叉会将 Tendedero 专用目录中的文件移到废纸篓；其他目录的文件只会从绳上取下。你可以从菜单栏关闭接管，退出时会恢复先前设置。";
"Rest the pointer on a photo to see it larger" = "将指针停在图片上即可放大";
"Save new screenshots to the chosen folder and hang them instantly" = "将新截图保存到所选目录并立即挂上晾衣绳";
"Show new items" = "自动展开新图片";
"The line comes down for a moment when something new hangs" = "新图片挂上时，晾衣绳会短暂展开";
"Use default screenshots folder" = "恢复默认截图目录";
"Zoom on hover" = "悬停放大";
